{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/29965","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:36.044354+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Fixed in https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/commit/cb44677bdf26a9650c2b89ee54c3f399251fadd6","created_at":"2025-07-06T00:30:23Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/29965#issuecomment-3040481544","id":3040481544,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/29965","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc61OhEI","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3040481544/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-07-06T00:30:23Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3040481544","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"### Description\n\nThe varying manual axes are lost when using the following functions: `jax.lax.full_like`, `jax.lax.zeros_like_array`\n\nmre:\n\n```python\nimport jax\njax.config.update(\"jax_num_cpu_devices\", 4)\n\nfrom functools import partial\nimport numpy as np\nfrom jax.sharding import Mesh, PartitionSpec as P, NamedSharding, AxisType, set_mesh\nfrom jax.experimental.shard_map import shard_map\n\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\n\nn = 1024\nm = 5\n\nmesh = Mesh(jax.devices(), 'S', axis_types = (AxisType.Explicit))\nset_mesh(mesh)\n\nk1, k2 = jax.random.split(jax.random.key(123))\nx = jax.random.uniform(k1, shape=(n,m), out_sharding=NamedSharding(mesh, P('S', None)))\np = jax.random.uniform(k2, shape=m, out_sharding=NamedSharding(mesh, P(None)))\n\ndef f(p, x):\n    return jnp.einsum('i, i->', x, p)\n\n@partial(shard_map, mesh=mesh, in_specs=(P(None), P('S', None)), out_specs=P('S'))\ndef g(p, x):\n    def _grad(f, p, x):\n        \n        # works\n        #return jax.grad(f)(p, x)\n\n        y, vjp_fun =  jax.vjp(f, p, x)\n\n        one = jax.lax.full_like(y, 1)\n\n        print('y:', jax.typeof(y).vma)\n        print('one:', jax.typeof(one).vma)\n\n        # works\n        #one = jax.lax.pvary(one, tuple(jax.typeof(y).vma))\n\n        return vjp_fun(one)\n        \n    return jax.lax.map(partial(_grad, f, p), x)\n\ng(p,x)\n```\n```\ny: frozenset({'S'})\none: frozenset()\n\nValueError: unexpected JAX type (e.g. shape/dtype) for argument to vjp function: got float32[], but expected float32[]{V:S} because the corresponding output of the function f had JAX type float32[]{V:S}\n```\n\nI think it would be useful to add a call to pvary in those functions.\n\nThis would simplify  https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/discussions/29608\n\n\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\njax:    0.7.0.dev20250703\njaxlib: 0.7.0.dev20250703\nnumpy:  1.26.4\npython: 3.12.4 (main, Jun  6 2024, 18:26:44) [Clang 15.0.0 (clang-1500.3.9.4)]\ndevice info: cpu-4, 4 local devices\"\nprocess_count: 1\nplatform: uname_result(system='Darwin', node='', release='24.4.0', version='Darwin Kernel Version 24.4.0: Fri Apr 11 18:33:47 PDT 2025; root:xnu-11417.101.15~117/RELEASE_ARM64_T6000', machine='arm64')\n```","closed_at":"2025-07-06T00:30:24Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/29965/comments","created_at":"2025-07-03T21:13:04Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/29965/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/29965","id":3200670655,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/29965/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc6-xlu_","number":29965,"performed_via_github_app":null,"